<title>GREECE: GSEE UNION TO PICK NEW PRESIDENT WEDS.</title>
<headline>GSEE UNION TO PICK NEW PRESIDENT WEDS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Confederation of Greek Workers union will convene on Wednesday to pick a new president to succeed Christos Protopapas who resigned, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
